#: ../../tools/kegg_ext_tools.rst:32 ad1b2ab9cb2343c7a0f04df083a09aac
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get KEGG compound/metabolite details including names, "
"formula, molecular weight, associated pathways, enzymes, and database "
"cross-references. Example: C00002 (ATP) has formula C10H16N5O13P3, "
"molecular weight 507.18, and is involved in hundreds of metabolic "
"reactions and pathways. Covers metabolites, cofactors, drugs, and other "
"small molecules in the KEGG COMPOUND database."
msgstr ""

